<div style="text-align: center;">
<h2><span><strong>SCP-4335:</strong> Are you humanity?</span></h2>
</div>
<hr />
<p>In a few months, it'll be Minecraft's 10 year anniversary. This is a love letter to one of the best games ever made.</p>
<p>Huge thanks to everyone who looked at it, including <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/adl3z" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4465081); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4465081&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1594361810" alt="Adl3z_" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4465081)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/adl3z" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4465081); return false;">Adl3z_</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/plaidypus" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4187161); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4187161&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1594361810" alt="plaidypus" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4187161)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/plaidypus" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4187161); return false;">plaidypus</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yossipossi" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2199269); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2199269&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1594361810" alt="Yossipossi" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2199269)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yossipossi" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2199269); return false;">Yossipossi</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/psul" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2156983); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2156983&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1594361810" alt="psul" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2156983)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:i